# Agent files under .claude/agents/ are byte-for-byte copies of the upstream agent
# library, which is stored with LF endings. `.claude/agents-refresh.py` compares the
# project copy against the library source as bytes, so a CRLF checkout on Windows
# would make every agent report as drifted and `--apply` would rewrite all of them
# on every run.
#
# Force LF regardless of the checkout platform or core.autocrlf setting.
* text eol=lf
